      </message>
      <message name="IDS_BRAVE_SYNC_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1" desc="Text for Brave Sync description.">
        Brave Sync allows you to sync bookmarks data privately between your Brave Browsers on your various devices.\n\nSimply scan the code from your sync chain that you created on another device. Or start a new sync chain.
      </message>
      <message name="IDS_BRAVE_SYNC_QRCODE_MESSAGE_V2" desc="Text for Brave Sync QR code message.">
